msgid "Temperature band limited"
msgstr "温区受限"

#. STRINGS.BUILDING.STATUSITEMS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.ZONELIMIT.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDING.STATUSITEMS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.ZONELIMIT.TOOLTIP"
msgid "The recipe best range exceeds the building's usable range; the limit applies to control mode. Default mode still produces at reduced efficiency, and forced run may work past the limit."
msgstr "配方最佳温区超出建筑可用范围，限制针对控制模式；默认模式仍按效率生产，强制运行可越过上限。"

